        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Suppliers beware. They owe us a payment since 2024 and do not answer their emails, and their phone always says not available. Do not do business with these crooks!!",
        "time": 1759847060,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Maria Drivakos",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107954900213691348164/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYZuSOjBkpQqfSKm55svfZAJD2bVt60DcJVn2gghL7cbb4Bw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Very happy with the delivery by Justin and Joe. They setup the couch and did a run test on the recliners before leaving. They were friendly and easy to speak to. They called us before arrival. I wish other service providers were as cordial and professional. Thank you!!!",
        "time": 1690563941,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eli G",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100225726737395761744/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVO2Nh2zRXHeT3p-8RLRIdZr9hoMUxTURFNI6NMuB6OQO1PKBE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Doug and Jim delivered a very heavy package to us from a Costco order.  Their service was excellent.  There was a mistake on Costco's part, that did not inform them that they had to deliver the package inside the apartment.  Even though it was Costcos mistake, these 2 guys took the furniture up 2 flights of stairs for us.  I told them my wife was pregnant, and they wanted to help us with our furniture, so they agreed to do it.  We are so thankful for their service, and would not hesitate to recommend them to anyone.  Thank you!!",
        "time": 1683069978,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sandra Andrade",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102998635643392799532/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX6HCXVDs0jdK5qfgIifr1B8aqp--Frb3Y5_RQ0Td79P9-NwLDKYg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I received a delivery for my dresser that I got from Costco Jan 24th,2004.The two gentlemen were very professional and had a smile.\nThey did a courtesy to drop the dresser in my entrance living room,which was truly appreciated.One thing that stood out was their attention to detail and how careful they were not to dirty my carpet with their boots with snow and how they placed the box.I would hire these guys in a heat beat.",
        "time": 1706189415,
